    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Prestigious Adare Address | Exceptional 4-Bedroom Contemporary Residence.\r\n\r\nSet within a secluded and private setting on 1 Acre of beautifully mature grounds, this impressive 4-bedroom residence offers a rare opportunity to acquire a distinguished property just minutes from the heart of Adare Village and the world-renowned Adare Manor, host venue of the Ryder Cup 2027.\r\nApproached by a sweeping driveway, the property immediately impresses with its sense of privacy, space and elegance. Designed by a respected local architect, the home features beautiful parquet flooring, bespoke cabinetry, double-height ceilings and light-filled accommodation throughout.\r\nAt the heart of the home lies a spacious beautifully appointed kitchen featuring integrated appliances, substantial breakfast bar and picturesque views of the mature rear gardens, a separate utility room with laundry facilities and guest W.C adds further convenience to everyday living.\r\nOff the kitchen is a warm and inviting family room with an open fireplace, the perfect retreat for relaxing by the fire after a busy day.\r\nFor more formal entertaining the property boasts an elegant dining room and an impressive living room centred around a magnificent feature fireplace with handcrafted copper hood, There are floor-to-ceiling windows, sliding patio doors connecting the interior to the outdoors perfect for entertaining and all your al fresco dining.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of the home is the convenience of the ground-floor Master bedroom suite, complete with floor-to-ceiling windows, fitted wardrobes, vanity unit and a private en-suite bathroom with a walk-in shower. A second guest bedroom is also located on the ground floor.\r\nUpstairs, there are two further generously proportioned bedrooms together with a full family bathroom comprising of a soaking tub, electric shower, pedestal wash hand basin and W.C.\r\nA substantial detached outbuilding incorporating a store room and office provides excellent potential for a home business, guest accommodation or extended family living. The beautifully maintained grounds include expansive lawns, mature trees, established planting and a charming orchard creating a private sanctuary rarely found so close to village amenities which include award-winning restaurants, hotels, boutique's and golf courses, walking distance to Schools and Adare's leisure and sport facilities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
