        "Content": "Ground Floor: Hallway, Sitting Room, Kitchen, Utility Room, Dining Room, Living Room, Master Bedroom w En-suite Bathroom, Guest Bedroom.\r\n1st Floor: Bedroom, Bedroom, Main Hall Bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Contemporary 4 Bedroom Dwelling set on C. 1 Acre of mature grounds and gardens.\t\r\nAdare - Prestigious Heritage Location with 5 Star Luxury Nearby-Host to The 2027 Ryder Cup\r\nMinutes from all Village amenities, Award Winning Restaurants, Pubs, Hotels, Boutiques, Shops, Schools and all Sports Facilities\r\n20 minute commute/drive to Limerick city and only 30 minute drive to Shannon Airport."
      },
